{% set text %}
The community of the buildings contains 1 building. Each building has its own meter measuring electrical consumption and another meter measuring heating consumption. 
Building "alice" shares the same electrical connection (same wiring) to several assets: a national electric grid, an electrical energy storage system, and a heat pump. 
The national electric grid connection allows for importing 20 kW and exporting 100 kW of electricity. 
The electrical energy storage system installed in the building "alice" has a maximum capacity of 25 kWh. 
The storage system's maximum charging power is 6 kW, and its discharging power is 6 kW. The storage system's charging and discharging efficiencies are 0.95. 
The heat pump installed in the building "alice" has a coefficient of performance of 3. 
The heat pump installed in the building "alice" has a maximum electrical consumption of 70 kW, and its maximum heat generation is 210 kW. 
Building "alice" has a connection to a heat pump.
{% endset %}

